# agent evals: run output (rows, screenshots, transcripts)
# Every run directory, not just the default one: `--out evals/.metrics-pi` is how two
# local legs avoid clobbering each other, and a bare `evals/.metrics/` let 139 files of
# transcripts and ledgers into a commit via `git add -A`.
evals/.metrics*/

